{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1378752-so-how-has-the-lock-down-quarantine-affected-your-vampire\u2019s-feeding","id":1378752,"title":"So how has the lock down/quarantine affected your vampire\u2019s feeding?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-04-05T07:30:14-07:00","id":1378752,"title":"So how has the lock down/quarantine affected your vampire\u2019s feeding?","content":"Most of us are probably being affected by some sort of restriction on movement to stop people getting sick. How would/is/will your campaign be affected by this happening? Which clans and covenants are hardest hit?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-05T07:57:25-07:00","id":1378759,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Live Bait</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1378752-so-how-has-the-lock-down-quarantine-affected-your-vampire\u2019s-feeding#post1378752\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Most of us are probably being affected by some sort of restriction on movement to stop people getting sick. How would/is/will your campaign be affected by this happening? Which clans and covenants are hardest hit?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think it's a bit a step back into Dark Age behaviors, going house by house.<br /> I'd say quite every Clan has its own means to deal with it:<br /> <br /> Obfuscate, Majesty, Protean, Dominate are probably the most effective disciplines.<br /> <br /> But also a smart using of animalism to let the dog escaping in that dark and lonley alley, can be helpful.<br /> <br /> I can see supermarkets as crowded of kindred at hunt \ud83d\ude05.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7079-marcus","name":"Marcus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7079_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-05T08:30:55-07:00","id":1378768,"title":"","content":"I think that this will result in a lot of boon trading<br /> <br /> Those usualy depending on back alleys Bars or night clubs will agree to owe boons to those who have Flocks of their own.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-05T09:43:22-07:00","id":1378780,"title":"","content":"I was actually inclined to think that many kindred would sleep it out. I realise it puts your territory at risk if you\u2019re not in a city with a strong government willing to safeguard their claims but the risk to the masquerade is high at the moment since anyone feeling woozy could be investigated and public guidelines could be updated at any time so you can\u2019t establish a routine isn\u2019t possible. I imagine the Ordo Dracol wants to gather data and the Invictus is quite eager for activity to be reduced to manageable levels, the church would probably be happy to let the virus bring people towards God and drop activity to protect the masquerade with the Circle seeing everything as a chance to test themselves.<br /> I also think Gangrel have a hard time ahead because their disciplines often require quite a bit of vitae compared to others, Venture might be best placed probably with Davea second and Mekhet a close third, that said the Nosferatu could be completely set or desperate depending on how they\u2019ve set themselves up.<br /> Obviously each city is different, in the city I\u2019m currently working on the Ordo would actually be at risk of loosing influence because they\u2019ve been dealing with day time operations for the prince and their actions now risk an increase in police scrutiny if they\u2019re deemed to be non essential, the Circle have a large centralised territory since the prince wanted them strong and able to back her when she came to power, the Lance have scattered holdings spread throughout the city so the faithful always have a church close by and the Invictus are spread out to ensure they can keep everything under control, they wouldn\u2019t be able to sleep through it because the Carthian Movement has been split into three territories one of which is a containment territory for the hardline revolution that the first estate has basically surrounded (the other two are a think tank for how to run assets effectively for the good of the city and the supposed mainstream who are willing to cooperate with the Invictus to ensure the best possible policy for all kindred) so shutting down their operations is going to be quite a challenge.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-05T11:31:13-07:00","id":1378811,"title":"","content":"I'm seeing overtaxed herds and opportunities to strike at weakened support structures. Hungry eyes have been just waiting to topple your Herds, Allies, Contacts, Resources, etc while maintaining plausible deniability.<br /> A little anemia and commensurately weakened immune system can be a viruses best friend and with businesses closing and stock markets bucking violently, you may wake up one night to find yourself bankrupt too.<br /> Not only that but with governments releasing prisoners, cops not responding to calls, and governments shutting down firearm sales to the law abiding, your daytime friends may just fall victim to the increasing burglaries and violent crime.<br /> Those who have the most right now have the most to lose, and those at the bottom of the vitae chain can smell blood in the water.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11661,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11661-rathamus","user":"Rathamus","date":". 04-05-2020, 02:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11661-rathamus","name":"Rathamus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11661_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-05T12:18:28-07:00","id":1378823,"title":"","content":"<br /> Bartering for favors from those with large herds might suddenly become more lucrative than bartering for tenurial hunting privileges but I actually think Kindred society would remain largely unchanged, the only thing that changes is who currently wields influence due to blood access and prospective victims from casual feeding. Those who cultivated herds or hunting territory in areas among humans who weren't cruising bars and brothels so they avoided spreading diseases in the first place didn't have their eating pattern disrupted in the slightest. The bar hoppers will have to make do with the essential personnel of grocery store cashiers, stockers, delivery drivers, and restaurant employees.<br /> Those who hold influence over government officials, infrastructure/utilities, and goods exchange are probably even more influential now.<br /> The entire country effectively being placed under house arrest means a kindred has an easier job watching their tenurial borders. They are less likely to have to worry about &quot;their&quot; vessels crossing over into some other vampire's territory and being someone else's meal. <br /> The homeless didn't magically disappear. Just because you are sitting in your house binging Netflix and have someone delivering your groceries to you and don't have to see them or think about them doesn't mean they aren't homeless anymore. And Covid-19 patients are perfect feeding victims with the news media eagerly providing Masquerade preserving assistance as they hope and pray for a high death ratio and encourage rampant paranoia over infection causing people to act even stupider than usual. If someone is labeled a carrier and subsequently dies shortly afterwards, the cause of death is going to be preemptively declared without an autopsy. <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5466-tsusasi","name":"tsusasi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5466_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-05T20:21:49-07:00","id":1378911,"title":"","content":"Not to be too much of a prick, but Thousands of people have died, many more are going to die and almost everyone I know has been negatively effected by being laid off work or are loosing their businesses. This is not really a topic that I think should be brought into game for some time to come, let alone in the middle of it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11720-redwulfe","name":"Redwulfe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11720_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"570"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-05T20:39:06-07:00","id":1378914,"title":"","content":"I'd agree Kind of.<br /> <br /> It could come across as bad taste.<br /> <br /> But everyone heres probably curious how the Virus effected things.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-05T21:41:15-07:00","id":1378922,"title":"","content":"It's a game set in the modern day, and has always been used as a lens to examine modern life and various aspects of it. I don't see it as tasteless.<br /> <br /> I do find it tasteless when real life tragedies are given a supernatural cause in the books (that is, if you said the virus was a Carthian plot for revolution or something), which has historically also been something WW and OPP have done, but simply having characters react to real life events not so much.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1692-maina","name":"Maina","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1692_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"724"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-06T03:05:27-07:00","id":1378960,"title":"","content":"It wasn\u2019t my intention to upset anyone and I\u2019m sorry if I did. Since this is probably (hopefully) the only time one of the extreme situations that show up in the supplements is going to show up in real life and probably in part because I\u2019m going stir crazy shut in my flat waiting for this cough to leave me and want to move my problems to fantasy land I thought it was worth examining how such conditions would actually effect the requiem and in part because it\u2019s always nice to talk about what\u2019s going on with those lucky enough to have a game.<br /> So I admit people being upset or worried about this didn\u2019t enter my thought process, I definitely could have done better there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-06T08:50:35-07:00","id":1378997,"title":"","content":"To be fair Day after my MS Diagnosis I Posted on the SJgames forum asking if this looks li ke Kobal or another Demon Princes handywork was told its kronos.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-06T12:08:53-07:00","id":1379032,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Live Bait</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1378752-so-how-has-the-lock-down-quarantine-affected-your-vampire\u2019s-feeding?p=1378960#post1378960\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It wasn\u2019t my intention to upset anyone and I\u2019m sorry if I did. Since this is probably (hopefully) the only time one of the extreme situations that show up in the supplements is going to show up in real life and probably in part because I\u2019m going stir crazy shut in my flat waiting for this cough to leave me and want to move my problems to fantasy land I thought it was worth examining how such conditions would actually effect the requiem and in part because it\u2019s always nice to talk about what\u2019s going on with those lucky enough to have a game.<br /> So I admit people being upset or worried about this didn\u2019t enter my thought process, I definitely could have done better there.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I don't think you have any ill will or are trying to make light of the situation. It could just be me overreacting to watching my business that was closed by the pandemic slowly circle the drain and worrying about some of my friends and family who are high risk. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> It probably would have been better if I just don't read this thread instead. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> That way you all can talk, but please just in case someone does come on here who has been impacted worse than myself. Try to be thoughtful, not saying you all haven't been, I am just saying what you all probably already know.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11720-redwulfe","name":"Redwulfe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11720_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"570"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}